        <mxCell id="c137" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1644" y="1580" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c138" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1688" y="1580" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e139" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#3F8624;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#3F8624;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c137" target="c138"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c140" value='&lt;span style="color:#232F3E;"&gt;infrastructure deployment&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1694" y="1570" width="210" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c141" value='&lt;span style="color:#545B64;"&gt;Managed services drawn once per AZ are one logical resource with a network interface in each subnet: the ALB (two nodes inside one boundary), the RDS Proxy default endpoint (two nodes) and each interface endpoint. Every ALB node runs the same listeners and, with cross-zone load balancing (always on for an ALB), can forward to a task in either AZ. Only the RDS primary and the Redis primary take application traffic; the standby and the replica exist for failover. Security groups chain alb-sg → task-sg → proxy-sg / cache-sg / endpoint-sg, and proxy-sg → db-sg, so only RDS Proxy can reach the database. The pipeline is started only by the EventBridge rule; its Git source has DetectChanges off.&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1600" width="1900" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
